# ── Secrets and real data. Nothing here may ever reach GitHub. ─────────────
# server/data/secret.key is the AES-256-GCM master key that decrypts every
# stored API key. emetai.db holds real churches, password hashes and sessions.
# Publishing either would be unrecoverable — keys can be rotated, a leaked
# database of a church's accounts cannot be un-leaked.
server/data/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem

# ── Model weights (239 MB). Too large for git, and downloadable. ───────────
server/models/
*.bin
*.onnx

# ── Build output and dependencies ──────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Python ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# ── Scratch: recordings, logs, and the throwaway scripts used for testing ──
*.wav
*.log
server/_*.py
server/bin/

# ── Editor and OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
deploy/.env
